{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_89","type":"agent_message","text":"# Implementation Notes\n\n## Decisions Made\n- Added daily `plant_growth` and `algae_growth` systems and wired them into `run_daily_update()`, so plant/algae biomass now changes once per day while existing hourly DO/DIC coupling scales automatically from current biomass.\n- Implemented guild-specific nutrient uptake biases with `FastStem` favoring water-column N/P and `RootFeedingRosette` favoring substrate stores, plus daily crowding, habitat, senescence, and health updates.\n- Extended `ProcessParams`, preset loading, and scenario conversion with plant/algae growth parameters so the new behavior is configurable and deterministic from saved state/presets.\n- Extended `TankSnapshot` with algae biomass, nuisance index, per-guild plant biomass, and remaining substrate nutrients for TUI/API observability.\n- Updated algae event emission to cover `AlgaeRiskRising`, `AlgaeBloom`, and `SubstrateFoulingWarning`, and changed `TrimPlants` so trimmed biomass enters `fine_detritus_g_total`.\n- Added acceptance/integration coverage for rooted substrate advantage, plant response to light/nutrients, uptake differentiation, algae bloom/overfeeding behavior, and trim-to-detritus routing.\n\n## Spec Deviations\n- None.\n\n## Testing\n- Verified with `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc -c cargo test --workspace`.\n- New acceptance tests: `rooted_substrate_advantage` and `plant_algae_integration`.\n- Verification created untracked build artifacts under `target/` and an untracked log under `.ralph/tmp/logs/`.\n\n---"}}
